  "Inspect line": "查看该行",
  "The compiler message above is shown unchanged. If it includes a line number, the error is at or before that line; otherwise, the lines preceding it in the raw output usually identify the cause.": "上方为编译器原始信息。如包含行号，错误位于该行或其之前；如无行号，原始输出中该信息之前的内容通常指明原因。",
  "The .bib entry at this line is malformed or duplicated; bibtex/biber skipped it, so citations of it remain unresolved. The usual cause is a missing comma or brace in the preceding field. Correct the entry and compile again.": ".bib 文件中该行的条目格式错误或重复，bibtex/biber 已将其跳过，相关引用将保持未定义。常见原因是上一字段末尾缺少逗号或花括号。修正条目后重新编译。",
  "The LaTeX executable was not found. Install a TeX distribution or configure its path in Settings → LaTeX. The document remains editable.": "未找到 LaTeX 可执行程序。请安装 TeX 发行版，或在“设置 → LaTeX”中配置路径。文档仍可编辑。",
  "Check the path relative to the project main document and the installed package version. Typst packages are downloaded only after confirmation.": "请检查相对于项目主文档的路径及已安装的宏包版本。Typst 宏包需确认后才会下载。",
  "The named font was not found. Check its spelling in the source (including spaces inside the braces), the file path relative to the main document, and whether the font is installed. Changing the engine does not resolve this.": "未找到指定字体。请检查源码中的字体名称拼写（包括花括号内的空格）、字体文件相对于主文档的路径，以及该字体是否已安装。更换引擎无法解决此问题。",
  "The document uses fontspec or Unicode text that pdfLaTeX does not support. Select XeLaTeX or LuaLaTeX under Typesetting.": "文档使用了 pdfLaTeX 不支持的 fontspec 或 Unicode 字符。请在“排版”中选择 XeLaTeX 或 LuaLaTeX。",
  "The typesetting engine is unavailable. Check the local installation and the configured executable path. Nothing is installed automatically.": "排版引擎不可用。请检查本机安装与已配置的可执行文件路径。不会自动安装任何软件。",
  "Check the spelling, and that the command is defined or imported before this use. Formula previews do not include document macros.": "请检查拼写，并确认该命令在此之前已定义或引入。公式预览不包含文档中定义的宏。",
  "Check this line and the preceding one for an unmatched brace, bracket, delimiter or environment.": "请检查该行及上一行是否存在未配对的花括号、方括号、定界符或环境。",
  "The document compiled, but this line exceeds the available width. Adjust the wording, line break or figure width instead of suppressing the warning.": "文档已编译，但该行超出版面宽度。建议调整措辞、换行位置或图片宽度，而非屏蔽该警告。",
  "The bibliography processor was not found. Check that the backend selected by the document (bibtex or biber) is installed and available in the TeX environment. Recompiling does not install it.": "未找到参考文献处理工具。请确认文档选用的后端（bibtex 或 biber）已安装且在 TeX 环境中可用。重新编译不会安装该工具。",
  "The bibliography database (.bib) or style (.bst) could not be opened. Check the named file and its path relative to the main document. Recompiling does not restore a missing file.": "无法打开参考文献数据库（.bib）或样式文件（.bst）。请检查所列文件及其相对于主文档的路径。重新编译无法恢复缺失的文件。",
  "The bibliography processor reported a failure. The raw output contains the specific error; check the named .bib entry, file or backend setting. Recompiling without correcting the cause repeats the failure.": "参考文献处理失败。具体错误见原始输出，请检查相应的 .bib 条目、文件或后端设置。未修正原因前重新编译仍会失败。",
  "The same label is defined more than once. Rename or remove the duplicate definition; recompiling does not resolve this.": "同一标签被重复定义。请重命名或删除重复的定义；重新编译无法解决此问题。",
  "Cross-references and citations may require additional passes. Compile again with latexmk. If they remain unresolved, check earlier bibliography errors, the loaded .bib files, and the spelling of citation keys and labels.": "交叉引用与文献引用可能需要多次编译。可使用 latexmk 重新编译；若仍未解析，请检查之前的参考文献错误、已加载的 .bib 文件以及引用键和标签的拼写。",
  "No matching entry in the loaded .bib files. Check the key and the bibliography source.": "已加载的 .bib 文件中没有匹配的条目。请检查引用键与文献来源。",
  "Bibliography entries could not be read. Hover again to retry.": "无法读取参考文献条目，请重新悬停以重试。",
  "Markdown": "Markdown",
  "Show Markdown source": "显示 Markdown 源码",
  "Toggle Markdown source": "切换 Markdown 源码",
  "The main document is not at its saved location; it may have been moved or deleted. Save it again with Save As, then compile.": "主文档不在其保存位置，可能已被移动或删除。请使用“另存为”重新保存后再编译。"
